  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nDue to a lack of agenda items, we cancelled our weekly triage call on 07/03/25 (https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11408) . The next one is scheduled for July 17, 6PM CET. Note that this is 2 weeks later in the Americas and Europe friendly time.\n\nPeople interested in attending the next call please respond here or reach out privately to @cwilso, or the editors. We will be tagging issues for the next call again using [agenda+](https://github.com/whatwg/html/labels/agenda%2B) in all WHATWG repositories across [issues](https://github.com/search?q=org%3Awhatwg+is%3Aopen+label%3Aagenda%2B&type=issues) and [pull requests](https://github.com/search?q=org%3Awhatwg+is%3Aopen+label%3Aagenda%2B&type=pullrequests) and we would like to invite anyone that can contribute to join us.",
